cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If RootScope helps your research, course, or robot project, please cite this software release."
title: "RootScope: AdventureX 2026 Silver Award and 2nd Place Stationary Root-Zone Irrigation Robot"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "RootScope Team"
    alias: "Xiaomiju-x"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xiaomiju-x/RootScope-AdventureX2026"
url: "https://github.com/Xiaomiju-x/RootScope-AdventureX2026"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.3
date-released: 2026-08-13
abstract: >-
  RootScope is a stationary RDK X5 and STM32F103C8T6 root-zone irrigation
  robot prototype. It won the Silver Award and finished second in the
  AdventureX 2026 D-Robotics “Give AI a Body” track. The release includes
  evidence-gated vision, local read-only LLM/RAG, fail-closed control,
  firmware, hardware documentation, pipelines, tests, and sanitized evidence.
keywords:
  - AdventureX 2026
  - D-Robotics
  - RDK X5
  - STM32F103
  - embodied AI
  - edge AI
  - computer vision
  - local LLM
  - RAG
  - irrigation robot
